    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "At this point... we're out of other options. Madam Ch'en, if you deny my request..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Rhodes Island will act alone."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "These actions don't violate any of the terms of our cooperation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Of course we'll be there."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...Is that so..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "In that case, thank you on behalf of Rhodes Island..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "I know that Lungmen still sees us as Infected..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "It's not a big deal."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "However, I'm not sure if our squads will be able to make it into the ruins."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "We'll have to play it by ear."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "If the situation allows, we will definitely help."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "However, our top priority is still to eliminate Reunion."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "That... that's enough for us."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "...Thank you, Madam Ch'en."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Sorry, I have my own duties."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "Did you hear me, Doc?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en",
        "text": "We will join up with Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
            "focus": -1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Amiya, be careful."
